    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Pattern-Seeking Mind.</strong> Your brain runs constant background scans on everything you see.</p><ul><li>You have a small mechanical bonus on <strong>Perception (Mind)</strong> and <strong>Insight (Soul)</strong> checks made to spot <strong>hidden patterns, inconsistencies, or anomalies</strong> in environments, documents, and conversations.</li><li>When the GM describes a scene, they may occasionally volunteer information like, “something here doesn’t quite fit,” even if you didn’t explicitly ask—your mind is always auditing.</li></ul>",
